# {{name}} · Ticket backlog

The backlog is the source of truth for the state of the work. Each ticket lives in its own
file in this directory; this table indexes them.

| Symbol | Meaning |
| :--- | :--- |
| ⏳ | Pending |
| 📝 | Proposed (not yet accepted) |
| 🔄 | In progress |
| ✅ | Done: every acceptance criterion is verified |
| ⏸️ | Deferred |

A ticket is only ✅ when its acceptance criteria are verified by a test or a documented inspection.
Keep the status line of the ticket (`> **Status:** …`) identical to its row here.

